    STR_PRISON_TYPE: Detention Block
    STR_NOT_ENOUGH_PRISON_SPACE: NOT ENOUGH CELLS!{SMALLLINE}Build a Detention Block or transfer prisoners to another base.
    STR_NO_ALIEN_CONTAINMENT_FOR_TRANSFER: NO DETENTION BLOCK AT THE DESTINATION!{SMALLLINE}Prisoners can only be sent to a base with a Detention Block.
    STR_CONTAINMENT_EXCEEDED: DETENTION BLOCK FULL!{SMALLLINE}Not enough cells at {0}. Prisoners over the limit must be handed to the civil authorities.
    STR_RETAINCORPSES: Keep prisoners after questioning
    STR_CANSELLLIVEALIENS: Prisoner transfers to the authorities
    STR_CANSELLLIVEALIENS_DESC: Allows prisoners to be handed to the civil authorities for a fee. Recommended when using storage limits.
    STR_STORAGELIMITSENFORCED_DESC: Enforces Detention Block and general store limits for prisoners and gear recovered from missions.
    STR_ALIEN_KILLS: Cobra troops killed
    STR_ALIEN_CAPTURES: Cobra troops captured
    STR_ALIEN_MOST_KILLS: Deadliest Cobra soldier
    STR_ALIEN_BASES_DESTROYED: Cobra sites destroyed
    STR_ALIEN_MISSILES_HAVE_DAMAGED_OUR_BASE: Cobra missiles have damaged our base {0}
    STR_ALIEN_MISSILES_HAVE_DESTROYED_OUR_BASE: Cobra missiles have destroyed our base {0}
    STR_COUNTRY_HAS_CANCELLED_A_SECRET_PACT: '{0} has broken its pact with Cobra and rejoined the project.'
    STR_COUNTRIES_HAVE_CANCELLED_A_SECRET_PACT: '{0} have broken their pact with Cobra and rejoined the project.'
    STR_UFO_TRACKER: Cobra Craft Tracker
    STR_UFO_LANDING_ALERT: Cobra landing alert
    STR_UFO_LANDING_ALERT_DESC: If enabled, a message pops up each time a detected Cobra craft lands.
    STR_MEETINGPOINT: Predict Cobra craft course
    STR_MEETINGPOINT_DESC: Our aircraft fly to meet a Cobra craft where its present course will take it.
    STR_DOGFIGHT_SPEED_DESC: Changes the speed of air battles with Cobra craft. Slower speeds can help on low-end devices.
    STR_INTERCEPT_TABLE_SIZE_DESC: 'Size of the tables in these windows: Intercept, Cobra Craft Tracker.'
    STR_AGGRESSIVERETALIATION_DESC: Cobra craft try to find your bases at all times, whatever their mission.
    STR_ALIEN_OPTIONS: COBRA OPTIONS
    STR_ALIENBLEEDING: Cobra bleeding
    STR_ALIENBLEEDING_DESC: Allows fatal wounds to be inflicted on most Cobra troops.
    STR_NOALIENPANICMESSAGES: Suppress panic messages for Cobra
    STR_NOALIENPANICMESSAGES_DESC: Don't show panic messages for Cobra troops unless they are visible to the player.
    STR_ALLOWPSIONICCAPTURE_DESC: Taking control of every remaining Cobra soldier wins the battle, and they count as captured.
    STR_WEAPONSELFDESTRUCTION: Cobra weapon self-destruction
    STR_BATTLEUFOEXTENDERACCURACY: Extended accuracy rules
    STR_SHOW_ACCURACY_ON_CROSSHAIR_DESC: '{ALT}0>{ALT}Never {ALT}1>{ALT}Only with extended accuracy rules {ALT}2>{ALT}Always'
